# System I/O native checks

## Glossary

| Term | Means |
|------|-------|
| checking binary crypto | call: crypto_checks(), source: checks.tnt |
| checking monotonic time | call: clock_checks(), source: checks.tnt |
| checking owned files | call: file_checks(), source: checks.tnt |

Feature: Binary cryptography
  id: feature.system_io_crypto

  Scenario: Exact bytes and authenticated tags
    When checking binary crypto
    → native assertions pass

Feature: Process-local monotonic time
  id: feature.system_io_clock

  Scenario: Checked deadlines and elapsed time
    When checking monotonic time
    → native assertions pass

Feature: Owned filesystem resources
  id: feature.system_io_files

  Scenario: Atomic binary writes and explicit cleanup
    When checking owned files
    → native assertions pass
